@k.words.ulcer.noun.1 k.words.sense word=ulcer pos=noun n=1 gloss="a circumscribed inflammatory and often suppurating lesion on the skin or an internal mucous surface resulting in necrosis of tissue" synonym=ulceration is_a=lesion core.source="wordnet 3.1"
@k.words.ultimate.noun.1 k.words.sense word=ultimate pos=noun n=1 gloss="the finest or most superior quality of its kind" is_a=quality core.source="wordnet 3.1"
@k.words.ultimatum.noun.1 k.words.sense word=ultimatum pos=noun n=1 gloss="a final peremptory demand" is_a=demand core.source="wordnet 3.1"
